WEBVTT

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:31.086
a uskoro -- vrlo uskoro --

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.783
čak i sam internet.

00:00:33.892 --> 00:00:40.089
Sve te usluge nisu zaštićene od oko 
pola milijuna predmeta

00:00:40.113 --> 00:00:42.233
veličine mrlje boje,

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:45.210
pa sve do veličine školskog autobusa.

00:00:46.398 --> 00:00:48.272
Mrlja boje,

00:00:48.296 --> 00:00:51.151
putujući odgovarajućom brzinom,

00:00:51.175 --> 00:00:52.733
u doticaju s jednim od ovih objekata

00:00:52.757 --> 00:00:55.406
mogla bi ih oštetiti
do stanja neupotrebljivosti.

00:00:56.394 --> 00:01:00.319
Ali ne možemo pratiti predmete
sićušne poput mrlje boje.